{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_WINCE__"}}----
Intrinsic define set for the Windows CE target.

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}
	""__FB_WINCE__""

{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Define without a value created at compile time for the ##wince-arm## and ##wince-mips## targets.  Windows CE also defines ##[[KeyPgDdfbwin32|__FB_WIN32__]]## so shared Windows data-model declarations remain available.  Use ##__FB_WINCE__## when code depends specifically on the CE API or its reduced CRT.

{{fbdoc item="ex"}}
%%(freebasic)
#ifdef __FB_WINCE__
	print "Windows CE target"
#endif
%%

{{fbdoc item="ver"}}
	- Since fbc 1.20.3

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- ##[[KeyPgDdfbarm|__FB_ARM__]]##
	- ##[[KeyPgDdfbmips|__FB_MIPS__]]##
	- ##[[CompilerOpttarget|Compiler Option: -target]]##

